            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments include methods for a user equipment (LTE) to advertise capabilities to a network node in a radio access network. Embodiments include transmitting, to the network node, an information element describing a plurality of feature sets supported by the UE and one or more BandCombination elements. The information element can include one or more InitialFeatureLists and one or more ExtensionFeatureLists, with each ExtensionFeatureList being associated with a particular InitialFeatureList. Each BandCombination element can include a list of frequency bands in which the UE is concurrently operable and one or more FeatureSetIdentifiers for each particular frequency band included in the list of frequency bands wherein each FeatureSetIdentifier is related to a particular InitialFeatureList and to an associated ExtensionFeatureList for that particular frequency band. Other embodiments include complementary methods performed by a network node.</p>
            </abstract>
